# Diabetes external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# Every source is disabled by default and installation requires acceptance of
# the external news feed sources agreement. Display is limited to headline,
# date, publisher attribution and outbound link.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-diabetes|MedlinePlus · Diabetes|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/diabetes.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official topic RSS with restricted reuse|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus offers the topic RSS feed, but its content-use policy limits feeds to personal use and does not authorize use in websites or information services|Not authorized by the published RSS terms|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Official Diabetes topic RSS. Disabled and agreement-gated; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
nlm-news-diabetes|National Library of Medicine · News|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/rss/nlmnews.rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official broad NLM news RSS; locally filtered|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works on its sites may be freely used in the United States with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify linked third-party material and do not imply NLM endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Disabled and locally filtered for explicit diabetes relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
nlm-director-diabetes|NLM Director · Musings from the Mezzanine|https://nlmdirector.nlm.nih.gov/feed/|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine · Office of the Director|Official broad NLM research and informatics RSS; locally filtered|31 July 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works on its sites may be freely used in the United States with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify linked third-party material and do not imply NLM endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Disabled and locally filtered for explicit diabetes relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
ada-diabetes-care-current|ADA Journals · Diabetes Care current issue|https://diabetesjournals.org/rss/site_1000003/1000004.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|American Diabetes Association · Diabetes Care|Official scholarly journal current-issue RSS with restricted reuse|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, journal attribution and outbound article link only|ADA offers citation and abstract RSS but holds copyright on journal content and requires permission for reproduction beyond its stated non-commercial reader uses; Health Signal does not display the feed abstract|Commercial reuse and redistribution require prior permission|Credit the American Diabetes Association and Diabetes Care and link to the version of record|https://diabetesjournals.org/journals/pages/license|permissions@diabetes.org|Verified HTTP 200 text/xml current-issue feed from the official ADA RSS directory. Disabled and agreement-gated; no abstract, article text, image or full content is stored or displayed.
